          "body": "<p>I have been trying to find the right words for a long time now. And I realize — there are no perfect words. There is only this: you make everything better.</p><p>Every morning is better because you exist. Every laugh is louder. Every silence is warmer. You somehow turned all the ordinary moments into my favorite memories.</p><p>I don't know how you do it, but you make me feel like the luckiest person alive — just by being you.</p><p>Thank you for choosing me, every single day.</p>",
